SUMMARY:Thurston Moore and Mark Wastell
DESCRIPTION:Timings:\nDoors 7:00 PM\, Music 7:30 PM - 1 set of music (SOLD OUT)\n*New show added due to popular demand*\nDoors 9:30 PM\, Music 10:00 PM - 1 set of music\nLine-up:\nThurston Moore - Guitar\nMark Wastell - Percussion\nAbout:\nA very welcomed return to the Vortex for the exciting electric guitar and drums collaboration between Thurston Moore and Mark Wastell. They played to a sell out audience last December\, a show which was described as “deeply post-psychedelic\, dreamlike in atmosphere\, before expanding into the charming spasms of free jazz.”\n\nTwo vastly experienced masters of the craft.\n\nGuaranteed to be another sell out - don’t hesitate to book your ticket.\n\nPhotos by Sean Kelly\, Vortex Jazz Club\, December 2025.\n\n \n\n[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUbYqrQDoqw[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/thurston-moore-and-mark-wastell/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
