SUMMARY:ONe_Orchestra New
DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nCaroline Kraabel – alto sax/voice\nKatherine Farnden - oboes\nKamila Wielebska - voice/dance\nIris Casling – double bass\nCath Roberts – saxes/electronics\nDee Byrne – alto sax\nSue Lynch - tenor sax/flute/clarinet\nBara Noha – voice\nRosa Theodora – keyboards/piano/voice\nEmmanuelle Waeckerle - voice/objects\nSaori Miraku - piano/keyboards\nKri – voice\nShama Rahman – sitar\nMegan Steinberg – turntables\nJane Perrot – voice\nAna Chora - electric guitar\nBarbara Mukoda - flutes\n\nAbout:\nONe_Orchestra New work in large-group improvisation to free themselves and their listeners from the default assumptions built up through the centuries-long predominance of cis men in music... This improvising orchestra's work opens up novel\, important\, and fascinating new forms\, relations\, AND sounds.\n\nImprovisation is\, by necessity\, a big part of being and surviving as ‘other’; conversely\, otherness – that everyone experiences somewhere in their heart – has a huge influence on the creation of improvisation. The shared experiences and sense of safety among ONe_Orchestra New members allow them to explore more boldly in their quest to uncover new ways of hearing\, as well as new things to hear.
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/one_orchestra-new-3/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=11 Gillett Square London N16 8AZ;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=11 Gillett Square:geo:-0.0764992,51.5487082
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/ONe_Orchestra-New-.jpeg
END:VEVENT
