SUMMARY:After John - Cosmic Music of Alice Coltrane
DESCRIPTION:PRESENTED BY ALINA BZHEZHINSKA\, TONY KOFI & YOUSUF ALI KHAN\nDoors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\nLine-up:\nAlina Bzhezhinska - Harp\nTony Kofi - Saxophone\nYousuf Ali Khan - Tabla\n\n \nAbout:\nAward-winning duo Alina Bzhezhinska (harp) and Tony Kofi (saxophone)\, joined by tabla virtuoso Yousuf Ali Khan\, present After John\, a celebration of the visionary music Alice Coltrane created following the passing of her husband and greatest musical collaborator\, John Coltrane.\n\nBlending jazz\, Indian classical traditions and spiritual improvisation\, this captivating performance explores her transcendent musical legacy\, taking audiences on an immersive journey of beauty\, contemplation and joy. Created exclusively for the EFG London Jazz Festival\, this special performance is a rare\, one-off event not to be missed.\n\n[embed]https://youtu.be/0nMBSauwTdU?si=MB8kcUtgL2S_kyOW[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/alina-bzhezhinska-after-john-cosmic-music-of-alice-coltrane/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=11 Gillett Square London N16 8AZ;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=11 Gillett Square:geo:-0.0764992,51.5487082
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Alina-Bzhezhinska-After-John-Cosmic-Music-of-Alice-Coltrane.jpeg
END:VEVENT
