SUMMARY:Ari Hoenig Trio featuring Tom Ollendorff and Viktor Nyberg (2 shows)
DESCRIPTION:Timings:\n*Please note each ticket will give you access to the time slot you book for. Please arrive for the door time.\n1st Show\nDoors 6:30 PM\, Music 7:00 PM – 1 set of music\n2nd Show\nDoors 8:30 PM\, Music 9:00 PM – 1 set of music\nLine-up:\nTom Ollendorff - Guitar\nViktor Nyberg - Double bass\nAri Hoenig - Drum kit\nAbout:\nFollowing his sold-out appearances at the Vortex in 2022\, legendary New York drummer Ari Hoenig returns with his acclaimed trio featuring Tom Ollendorff and Viktor Nyberg.\n\nWidely regarded as one of the jazz world's leading drummers and among its most celebrated contemporary musicians\, Hoenig is renowned for his astonishing rhythmic imagination and melodic approach to the drum kit. Performing music from their critically acclaimed album Enchanted\, the trio combines Hoenig's innovative rhythmic approach with Ollendorff's lyrical guitar work and Nyberg's deeply melodic bass playing\, creating music of remarkable interplay\, subtlety and spontaneity.\n\n \n\n[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d1zPpLdc-Go&list=RDd1zPpLdc-Go&start_radio=1&t=8s[/embed]\n\nEvent Date
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/ari-hoenig-trio-featuring-tom-ollendorff-and-viktor-nyberg-2-shows/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=11 Gillett Square London N16 8AZ;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=11 Gillett Square:geo:-0.0764992,51.5487082
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ari-Hoenig-Trio-featuring-Tom-Ollendorff-and-Viktor-Nyberg-2-shows.jpeg
END:VEVENT
