SUMMARY:James Allsopp Group
DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nJames Allsopp - Tenor saxophone\, Synthesizer\nChris Batchelor - Trumpet\nZands Duggan - Percussion\nDave Storey - Drum kit\nRiaan Vosloo - Bass guitar\nAbout:\nFor this performance we will be playing music from our forthcoming album “The Forest Speaks” set for release on London based Batov records in 2027.\n\nThe album has been produced in collaboration with Ben Lamdin\n(Nostalgia 77) and the psychedelic\, dub aesthetic of the production enhances and deepens the atmosphere of the record and that’s the experience we want to give the listener at the gig!\n\nThis is joyous\, life affirming music. Deceptively simple\, deeply melodic with a healthy dose of the other worldly.\n\n \n\n[embed]https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=bTaJCvFRp7o&pp=ygUcSmFtZXMgYWxsc29wcCBncm91cCBmaXNodGFuaw%3D%3D&ra=m https://open.spotify.com/album/2x18fkRYPpfmVIvAlPi8wm?si=OBTNrZSMRwGQfllXO5NhfA&utm_source=copy-link[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/james-allsopp-group-2/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
