DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nBasil Hodge - Piano\nTony Kofi - Alto saxophone\nOli Hayhurst - Double bass\nAlfonso Vitale - Drum kit\n\n \nAbout:\nPianist and composer Basil Hodge has been a mainstay of the British Jazz scene since the early nineties. The band will play Basil’s compositions from his critically acclaimed album 'A Point of Reference' with some of his early tunes. You will hear contemporary Jazz with a cohesive blend of swing Latin and funk rhythms.\n\n \n\n[embed]https://youtu.be/Hnu7a8XKI3Y[/embed]
