SUMMARY:Queer Jazz: Christmas Party Jam
DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM\n \nLine-up:\nLulu Manning\nBel Comeau\nArowah\nRosetta\nAbout:\nQueer Jazz is ending the year in style by bringing together four pioneering improvisers for an incredibly special night. Expect ambient soundscapes\, captivating musicianship and intimate moments.\n\nQueer Jazz\, founded by Tina Edwards and Arowah\, exists to platform\, nurture and celebrate the emerging queer jazz scene. For this night they have assembled a very special quartet of exceptional and experimental musicians from the emerging queer jazz scene.\n\n \n\n[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A-doAFIL9rA[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/queer-jazz-christmas-party-jam-2/
