SUMMARY:Mark Lockheart – Shapeshifter Trio
DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nMark Lockheart - saxes\, bass clarinet\, electronics\nHuw V Williams - bass\nJay Davis - drums and percussion\nAbout\nShapeshifter is a new trio featuring three very special creative voices of the UK scene.\n\nCreating a unique sonic experience this new trio shifts moment to moment\, gracefully and spontaneously stitching together sound landscapes and grooves.\n\nTaking the exploratory spirit of groups like Polar Bear and Malija the band move together through a common language of jazz\, rock\, classical and free improvisation exploring dark textures and dramatic musical shifts as they revel in the unexpected!\n\nShapeshifter’s debut album was released on Vinyl and CD on March 6th 2026.\n\nAll crucial musicians and composers on the UK music scene\, between them Shapeshifter have played with a glittering array of artists including: Dave Holland\, Django Bates\, Jim Black\, Kenny Wheeler\, Norma Winstone\, Laura Jurd\, Rob Luft\, Elliot Galvin\, Polar Bear\, Perfect Houseplants\, Loose Tubes and Radiohead.\n\n[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ShRLjHVV5ds[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/mark-lockheart-shapeshifter-trio-2/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
