DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nJohn Etheridge - Guitar\nVimala Rowe - Vocals\nPete Whittaker - Organ\nIan Thomas - Drum kit\nAbout:\nThe sensational vocalist Vimala Rowe joins guitar legend John Etheridge's Blue Spirits (Pete Whittaker (organ) and Ian Thomas (drums) for a post Christmas treat of jazz\, blues and global music. Vimala and John have a long established and celebrated partnership and the Blue Spirits Trio is ever popular at the Vortex.\nThis will be a soulful and powerful night.
