SUMMARY:The Procrastinators NYE Party
DESCRIPTION:Doors 7:45 PM\, Music 8:30 PM - 2 sets of music\n \nLine-up:\nGina Boreham - Voice\nPiotr Jordan - Violin\nPaul Moylan - Double bass\nZac Gvirtzman - Piano\n\n \nAbout:\nPlease join the Procrastinators as they celebrate the New Year - as per tradition - one day late.\n\nSo you can stay at home and do your first-footing\, watch Jools Holland or hit your local. Then come and celebrate for real on 1st January - with great music\, good company\, normal prices and a countdown to midnight at a time that suits - using the special Procrastinators' Clock.\n\nGypsy and Hotclub jazz\, tango\, Klezmer and some jazz standards from some of the best musos in London!
