SUMMARY:Calum Gourlay Big Band: Celebrating Burns Night
DESCRIPTION:Timings:\n*Please note each ticket will give you access to the time slot you book for. Please arrive for the door time.\n1st Show\nDoors 7:00 PM\, Music 7:30 PM – 1 set of music\n2nd Show\nDoors 9:15 PM\, Music 9:45 PM – 1 set of music\n\n\n\nAbout:\nJoin Calum Gourlay’s big band for an unforgettable Burn’s Night celebration. Featuring a band comprised of London’s thriving Scottish jazz community\, tonight’s gig includes Calum’s own musical arrangements and compositions\, comprising striking new material\, haunting and evocative melodies as well as reimagined jazz standards. Tickets are limited and include a nip of whiskey to toast Burns’ Immortal memory\, the vibrant artistic community in London and our good health.\n\n“Here's a bottle and an honest friend!\nWhat wad ye wish for mair\, man?\nWha kens\, before his life may end\,\nWhat his share may be o' care\, man.\n\nThen catch the moments as they fly\,\nAnd use them as ye ought\, man;\nBelieve me\, happiness is shy\nAnd comes not ay when sought\, man.”\n\nA Bottle and Friend - Robert Burns\n\n\n[embed]https://youtu.be/6dYf-QTpvXc?si=ml4UTQ_F9RPHEOCx[/embed]
URL:https://www.vortexjazz.co.uk/event/calum-gourlay-big-band-celebrating-burns-night/
LOCATION:11 Gillett Square\, London\, N16 8AZ
GEO:51.5487082;-0.0764992
